+* <news item>
+
+**Changed:**
+
+* The RelativeHybridTopologyProtocol will now raise a ValueError during validation if the atom mapping would result in breaking a chemical bond, which is not supported by the protocol, preventing execution of the simulation.
+
+**Deprecated:**
